cb9:revision:4","quote":"外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂：局部抑制JAK-STAT信号通路，降低I型/II型细胞因子受体信号传导，减轻AD的Th2型炎症与瘙痒；系统暴露极低（较口服低约90%）","quote_sha256":"4dd0ea93c790137e6de06d5eb405f94ea1ab938ceebafe4030f59f09f351f8ba","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_mech"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%（60g/支）或匹配赋形剂","quote_sha256":"f6a06d204732c14008b959adc68fdb2c4daeb79c02a980e30280c06b4800d76a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_pack"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"依从性由日记与药量清点双核查","quote_sha256":"a30bdc584e4e151c96cf8bb22d6e2f917cc3e2a7cabfa3c6a9c6c2e689054046","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_compliance"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_def_drug","es_study_def_dose","es_study_def_mech","es_study_def_pack","es_study_def_compliance"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"查阅给药操作手册或IB中局部外用JAK抑制剂的用量限制章节","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_bsadose","missing_source_classes":["给药操作手册","IB"],"target":"单周用量上限按BSA核定的具体分级阈值"},{"action":"确认是否需独立人员评估或仅凭制剂工艺保证","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_blind_verify","missing_source_classes":["制剂质量标准"],"target":"赋形剂与试验药外观气味一致性的盲态验证方法"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":["制剂质量标准或IB（含辅料、储存条件、有效期）","给药操作手册（含BSA分级用量上限具体数值）"],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验用药品为磷酸芦可替尼乳膏（ruxolitinib cream），系外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂，以1.5%浓度制成外用乳膏制剂，每支60g，用于薄涂于特应性皮炎受累皮肤。其作用机制为局部抑制JAK-STAT信号通路，降低I型及II型细胞因子受体信号传导，从而减轻特应性皮炎的Th2型炎症反应与瘙痒症状；经皮吸收后系统暴露极低，较口服给药低约90%。对照用赋形剂（vehicle）乳膏不含活性成分，外观与气味与试验药一致，以维持双盲设计。试验药与对照药均按每日两次（早晚）薄涂受累部位成薄层给药，用药后洗手（治疗手部除外）。研究期间依从性通过受试者每日瘙痒电子日记与每次访视药量清点双重核查。","rationale":"药物名称、浓度、剂型、包装规格、给药频率、作用机制及系统暴露数据均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。单周用量上限按BSA核定的具体分级数值、赋形剂盲态验证方式及辅料组成未在本批次来源中提供，需医学经理核实后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_73efb56c7af822a2","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ae1147f6a2486955b74e4686","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:07d6f64c91e3a6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:19c9ebe4894c86","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007140104_626e5883","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"磷酸芦可替尼乳膏（ruxolitinib cream，外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂）","quote_sha256":"579651c954d881e6634d839292aba935f192db58df92e836eb864af4e2672743","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_drug"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%（60g/支）或匹配赋形剂：每日两次（早晚）薄涂受累部位成薄层，用药后洗手（治疗手部除外）；单周用量上限按BSA核定并清点回收","quote_sha256":"ca21a74814302819280b671f58ccd453963ab87d5680588a13852974ea0a97dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%（60g/支）或匹配赋形剂","quote_sha256":"f6a06d204732c14008b959adc68fdb2c4daeb79c02a980e30280c06b4800d76a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_pack"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"依从性由日记与药量清点双核查","quote_sha256":"a30bdc584e4e151c96cf8bb22d6e2f917cc3e2a7cabfa3c6a9c6c2e689054046","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"es_study_def_compliance"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_def_drug","es_study_def_dose","es_study_def_pack","es_study_def_compliance"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"查阅IB或制剂质量标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_storage","missing_source_classes":["IB","制剂质量标准"],"target":"储存温度、湿度条件及有效期"},{"action":"确认标签模板及GCP标签要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_label","missing_source_classes":["标签规范文件"],"target":"标签内容规范（含盲态标识、批号、有效期、储存条件等）"},{"action":"查阅药品管理SOP","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_611_dispense_qty","missing_source_classes":["药品管理SOP"],"target":"各访视发药量计算规则及药品编号分配方式"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["制剂质量标准或IB（辅料、储存条件、有效期、标签规范）","药品管理SOP（编号分配、各访视发药量计算）"],"proposal_text":"试验药为磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%，每支60g，外用乳膏剂型，活性成分为磷酸芦可替尼（ruxolitinib phosphate），属小分子外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂。对照药为匹配赋形剂（vehicle）乳膏，不含活性成分，外观与气味与试验药一致，同法每日两次使用。两组药物均于第1天（基线/随机访视）首次发放，此后按访视计划逐次补充。主期（第1至8周）与延长期（第9至52周）均使用同一规格制剂。依从性评价采用日记记录与药量清点双核查方式，每次访视时由研究者或指定人员核对受试者带回的剩余药量与日记记录的一致性。","rationale":"药物规格、剂型、对照药描述、主期与延长期时长、依从性核查方式均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。辅料组成、具体储存温度与有效期、标签内容规范、各访视发药量计算规则及药品编号分配方式在本批次允许来源中未提供，需查阅制剂质量标准或IB后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_c8c9e22a893639eb","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ae1147f6a2486955b74e4686","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:07d6f64c91e3a6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:19c9ebe4894c86","company_corpus:cms_cn_